      "cooked": "<p>Five heroes (The Wraith, Absolute Zero, Visionary, Expatriette, Bunker) against Advanced Omnitron.</p>\n<p>First villain card was an Electro-Pulse Explosive. The other Electro-Pulse Explosive came out in the second round.</p>\n<p>We made a valiant attempt and it was one of the best uses of the Telekinetic Cocoon that I’ve seen (Visionary had more HP than the rest of the heroes combined), but our heroes went down and went down fast.</p>",
