      "created_at": "2012-07-04T11:30:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ouch. We played against Omnitron for the first time the other night and I hadn’t looked through the deck at all, so my eyes bulged a bit when he played an EPE. Luckily one of us had a card (I forget which) that could stall it for a round, Ra and Wraith were dealing decent amounts of damage by that point (and we weren’t playing advanced mode either), so we took it down. He also pulled two disintegration beams in a row before we disabled it. Thank goodness for Visionary and her ‘destroy ongoing’ power card.</p>",
