      "created_at": "2012-07-06T18:48:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We got murdered by Grand Warlord Voss… basically it was a long game with lots of ups and downs and then BAM he brings his entire army from the graveyard back into play. We were doing 2 players (each with 2 heroes) and the dude I was playing with said “I’m flipping the table, ^&amp;%# this”. I dont even remember if it was enough minions for us to auto lose, but certainly it was hopeless at that point.</p>",
